// Translated to SGL from bgfx examples/54-s2h/fs_s2h_screen.sc, with common/s2h/s2h.sh, s2h_bgfx.sh and s2h.hlsl.
// The original carries no copyright line; bgfx: Copyright 2010-2026 Branimir Karadzic. BSD-2-Clause: sources/bgfx/LICENSE.
